WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.005 --> 00:00:20.629
"Cat must go!" the king cried.

2
00:00:20.629 --> 00:00:23.534
"We can't have fleas in the castle!"

3
00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:26.144
Dirk had a wicked smile.

4
00:00:26.144 --> 00:00:29.283
"I'll get rid of Cat," he said.

5
00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:33.441
Cat hissed loudly.

6
00:00:33.441 --> 00:00:35.658
The queen looked at Tom.

7
00:00:35.658 --> 00:00:39.076
"Tom is not scratching," she said.

8
00:00:39.076 --> 00:00:42.483
"So the fleas are not coming from Cat."

9
00:00:42.484 --> 00:00:48.520
Prince Eric scratched. "I'm so itchy!"

10
00:00:48.521 --> 00:00:51.267
"Maybe I can help," Tom said.

11
00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:53.410
He waved his wand.

12
00:00:53.410 --> 00:00:57.830
"Stop scratching!" he cried.

13
00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:01.940
Everybody's hands froze.

14
00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:04.424
The scratching stopped.

15
00:01:04.424 --> 00:01:08.250
But the itching didn't stop.

16
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:12.085
"This is worse than before!" the king cried.

17
00:01:12.085 --> 00:01:14.612
"Oops," Tom said.

18
00:01:14.612 --> 00:01:18.914
"We must get rid of the fleas," the queen said.

19
00:01:18.914 --> 00:01:24.551
"Let's clean the castle!"

20
00:01:24.551 --> 00:01:32.497
Servants brought buckets of soap and water.

21
00:01:32.497 --> 00:01:38.459
They scrubbed all the floors and walls.

22
00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:44.634
They scrubbed the thrones.

23
00:01:44.635 --> 00:01:50.064
"Now everybody takes a bath!" the queen said.

24
00:01:50.064 --> 00:01:53.382
"It's Monday," the king said.

25
00:01:53.382 --> 00:01:57.087
"We take baths on Saturday," Dirk said.

26
00:01:57.087 --> 00:01:59.964
The queen frowned.

27
00:01:59.964 --> 00:02:05.263
Everybody went to take a bath.

28
00:02:05.263 --> 00:02:12.695
The next morning the castle was spotless.

29
00:02:12.695 --> 00:02:18.678
"The fleas have fled!" the king said.

30
00:02:18.678 --> 00:02:24.341
But soon the king's feet itched.

31
00:02:24.341 --> 00:02:27.574
Dirk's neck itched.

32
00:02:27.574 --> 00:02:30.181
Dirk glared at Tom.

33
00:02:30.181 --> 00:02:34.120
Only Tom was not scratching.

34
00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:38.062
"I know that Cat has fleas," Dirk thought.

35
00:02:38.063 --> 00:02:46.819
"But somehow she's protecting Tom."
